        'published_at' => '2026-07-27',
        'en' => "MoHRE fines 42 domestic worker offices; use only licensed ones\n\nMoHRE fined 42 domestic worker recruitment offices for 135 violations in the first half of 2026, Khaleej Times and Gulf News reported on 27 July 2026. The ministry said 138 licensed offices are active and advised using only those on its website. Report problems to MoHRE on 80084.\n\nSource: Khaleej Times, Gulf News\nhttps://www.khaleejtimes.com/uae/uae-fines-42-domestic-worker-agencies-for-135-violations-in-six-months",
        'am' => "MoHRE 42 የቤት ሠራተኛ ቢሮዎችን ቀጣ፤ ፈቃድ ያላቸውን ብቻ ይጠቀሙ\n\nMoHRE በ2026 የመጀመሪያ አጋማሽ 42 የቤት ሠራተኛ ቀጣሪ ቢሮዎችን በ135 ጥሰቶች ቀጥቷል (Khaleej Times እና Gulf News፣ ሐምሌ 27 ቀን 2026)። ሚኒስቴሩ 138 ፈቃድ ያላቸው ቢሮዎች እንዳሉና በድረ-ገጹ ላይ ያሉትን ብቻ እንዲጠቀሙ መክሯል። ችግር ካለ ለMoHRE በ80084 ያሳውቁ።\n\nምንጭ፦ Khaleej Times, Gulf News\nhttps://www.khaleejtimes.com/uae/uae-fines-42-domestic-worker-agencies-for-135-violations-in-six-months",
        'ti' => "MoHRE 42 ቤት ጽሕፈት ሰራሕተኛታት ገዛ ቀጺዑ፤ ፍቓድ ዘለዎም ጥራይ ተጠቐሙ\n\nMoHRE ኣብ ፈለማ ፍርቂ 2026 42 ቤት ጽሕፈት ምልመላ ሰራሕተኛታት ገዛ ብ135 ጥሕሰታት ቀጺዑ (Khaleej Times ከምኡ'ውን Gulf News፣ 27 ሓምለ 2026)። እቲ ሚኒስትሪ 138 ፍቓድ ዘለዎም ቤት ጽሕፈታት ከም ዘለዉን ኣብ መርበቡ ዘለዉ ጥራይ ክትጥቀሙን መኺሩ። ጸገም እንተሃልዩ ንMoHRE ብ80084 ሓብሩ።\n\nምንጪ፦ Khaleej Times, Gulf News\nhttps://www.khaleejtimes.com/uae/uae-fines-42-domestic-worker-agencies-for-135-violations-in-six-months",
        'om' => "MoHRE waajjiraalee hojjettoota manaa 42 adabe; kanneen hayyama qaban qofa fayyadamaa\n\nMoHRE walakkaa jalqabaa 2026 keessa waajjiraalee qacarrii hojjettoota manaa 42 dogoggora 135n adabe (Khaleej Times fi Gulf News, 27 Adooleessa 2026). Ministeerichi waajjiraaleen hayyama qaban 138 akka jiran himee, kanneen marsariitii isaa irra jiran qofa akka fayyadaman gorseera. Rakkoo MoHRE 80084 irratti gabaasaa.\n\nMadda: Khaleej Times, Gulf News\nhttps://www.khaleejtimes.com/uae/uae-fines-42-domestic-worker-agencies-for-135-violations-in-six-months",
    ],
    [
        'topic' => 'consulate',
        'published_at' => '2026-07-09',
        'en' => "The visa grace period ended on 9 July 2026\n\nThe UAE's ICP gave people affected by flight disruption from 10 June to 9 July 2026 to fix their status or leave, Khaleej Times reported. Gulf News said on 9 July that normal overstay rules were expected after that. We found no extension. If you are unsure about your status or a fine, check with ICP or GDRFA Dubai.\n\nSource: Gulf News, Khaleej Times\nhttps://gulfnews.com/living-in-uae/visa-immigration/uae-30-day-visa-grace-period-ends-today-what-affected-travellers-need-to-know-1.500602025",
        'am' => "የቪዛ የእፎይታ ጊዜ ሐምሌ 9 ቀን 2026 አብቅቷል\n\nየኤምሬትስ ICP በበረራ መስተጓጎል ለተጎዱ ሰዎች ከሰኔ 10 እስከ ሐምሌ 9 ቀን 2026 (እ.ኤ.አ.) ሁኔታቸውን እንዲያስተካክሉ ወይም እንዲወጡ ጊዜ ሰጥቶ ነበር (Khaleej Times)። Gulf News ከዚያ በኋላ መደበኛው ሕግ እንደሚሠራ ጠቁሟል። ማራዘሚያ አላገኘንም። ስለ ሁኔታዎ ወይም ቅጣት እርግጠኛ ካልሆኑ ICP ወይም GDRFA Dubai ይጠይቁ።\n\nምንጭ፦ Gulf News, Khaleej Times\nhttps://gulfnews.com/living-in-uae/visa-immigration/uae-30-day-visa-grace-period-ends-today-what-affected-travellers-need-to-know-1.500602025",
        'ti' => "ናይ ቪዛ ግዜ ምሕረት ኣብ 9 ሓምለ 2026 ተወዲኡ\n\nICP ኢማራት ንብሰንኪ ምዝራግ በረራ ዝተጸልዉ ሰባት ካብ 10 ሰነ ክሳብ 9 ሓምለ 2026 ኩነታቶም ከስተኻኽሉ ወይ ክወጹ ግዜ ሂቡ ነይሩ (Khaleej Times)። Gulf News ድሕሪኡ ልሙድ ሕጊ ከም ዝቕጽል ገሊጹ። ምንዋሕ ኣይረኸብናን። ብዛዕባ ኩነታትኩም ወይ መቕጻዕቲ እንተዘይተረጋገጽኩም ንICP ወይ GDRFA Dubai ሕተቱ።\n\nምንጪ፦ Gulf News, Khaleej Times\nhttps://gulfnews.com/living-in-uae/visa-immigration/uae-30-day-visa-grace-period-ends-today-what-affected-travellers-need-to-know-1.500602025",
        'om' => "Yeroon dabalataa viizaa 9 Adooleessa 2026 xumurameera\n\nICP UAE namoota addaan citiinsa balalii irraan miidhamaniif 10 Waxabajjii hanga 9 Adooleessa 2026 haala isaanii akka sirreeffatan ykn akka ba'an yeroo kennee ture (Khaleej Times). Gulf News sana booda seerri idilee akka hojjetu eereera. Dabalata hin arganne. Waa'ee haala keessanii ykn adabbii yoo mirkaneeffachuu baattan ICP ykn GDRFA Dubai gaafadhaa.\n\nMadda: Gulf News, Khaleej Times\nhttps://gulfnews.com/living-in-uae/visa-immigration/uae-30-day-visa-grace-period-ends-today-what-affected-travellers-need-to-know-1.500602025",
    ],
    [
        'topic' => 'travel',
        'published_at' => '2026-06-25',
        'en' => "UAE widens visa on arrival to six countries; Ethiopia is not named\n\nThe National reported on 25 June 2026 that UAE visa on arrival now covers citizens of Indonesia, Vietnam, Thailand, the Philippines, Kenya and South Africa who hold a residence permit from listed countries. Ethiopia and Eritrea are not among the six. Be careful with any offer that says otherwise, and check with ICP.\n\nSource: The National, Khaleej Times\nhttps://www.thenationalnews.com/news/uae/2026/06/25/uae-extends-visa-on-arrival-programme-to-citizens-of-six-countries/",
        'am' => "ኤምሬትስ ሲደርሱ የሚሰጥ ቪዛን ለስድስት አገሮች አሰፋች፤ ኢትዮጵያ አልተጠቀሰችም\n\nThe National ሰኔ 25 ቀን 2026 (እ.ኤ.አ.) እንደዘገበው፣ ሲደርሱ የሚሰጠው ቪዛ ከተዘረዘሩ አገሮች የመኖሪያ ፈቃድ ላላቸው የኢንዶኔዥያ፣ ቬትናም፣ ታይላንድ፣ ፊሊፒንስ፣ ኬንያና ደቡብ አፍሪካ ዜጎች ተፈቅዷል። ኢትዮጵያና ኤርትራ ከስድስቱ ውስጥ የሉም። ሌላ የሚሉ ማስታወቂያዎችን ይጠንቀቁ፤ ICP ይጠይቁ።\n\nምንጭ፦ The National, Khaleej Times\nhttps://www.thenationalnews.com/news/uae/2026/06/25/uae-extends-visa-on-arrival-programme-to-citizens-of-six-countries/",
        'ti' => "ኢማራት ኣብ ምብጻሕ ዝወሃብ ቪዛ ንሽዱሽተ ሃገራት ኣስፊሓ፤ ኢትዮጵያ ኣይተጠቕሰትን\n\nThe National ኣብ 25 ሰነ 2026 ከም ዝጸብጸቦ፣ ኣብ ምብጻሕ ዝወሃብ ቪዛ ካብ ዝተዘርዘራ ሃገራት ፍቓድ መንበሪ ንዘለዎም ዜጋታት ኢንዶነዥያ፣ ቬትናም፣ ታይላንድ፣ ፊሊፒንስ፣ ኬንያን ደቡብ ኣፍሪቃን ተፈቒዱ። ኢትዮጵያን ኤርትራን ካብተን ሽዱሽተ ኣይኮናን። ካልእ ንዝብሉ ቅናሻት ተጠንቀቑ፤ ንICP ሕተቱ።\n\nምንጪ፦ The National, Khaleej Times\nhttps://www.thenationalnews.com/news/uae/2026/06/25/uae-extends-visa-on-arrival-programme-to-citizens-of-six-countries/",
        'om' => "UAE viizaa yeroo ga'umsaa biyyoota jahaaf bal'isite; Itoophiyaan hin eeramne\n\nThe National 25 Waxabajjii 2026 akka gabaasetti, viizaan yeroo ga'umsaa lammiilee Indoneezhiyaa, Veetnaam, Taayilaand, Filippiinsi, Keeniyaa fi Afrikaa Kibbaa hayyama jireenyaa biyyoota tarreeffaman irraa qabaniif hayyamameera. Itoophiyaa fi Eertiraan jahan keessa hin jiran. Waan biraa kan jedhu of eeggadhaa; ICP gaafadhaa.\n\nMadda: The National, Khaleej Times\nhttps://www.thenationalnews.com/news/uae/2026/06/25/uae-extends-visa-on-arrival-programme-to-citizens-of-six-countries/",
    ],
    [
        'topic' => 'consulate',
        'published_at' => '2026-01-15',
        'en' => "New Ethiopian Consul General in Dubai and the Northern Emirates\n\nThe UAE Ministry of Foreign Affairs said on 15 January 2026 that its Dubai office received the credentials of Zerihun Megersa Jima as Consul General of Ethiopia in Dubai and the Northern Emirates. The statement does not mention any change to consular services.\n\nSource: UAE Ministry of Foreign Affairs\nhttps://www.mofa.gov.ae/en/mediahub/news/2026/1/15/uae-ethiopia",
        'am' => "በዱባይና በሰሜናዊ ኤምሬቶች አዲስ የኢትዮጵያ ቆንስል ጄኔራል\n\nየኤምሬትስ የውጭ ጉዳይ ሚኒስቴር ጥር 15 ቀን 2026 (እ.ኤ.አ.) እንደገለጸው፣ የዱባይ ቢሮው የዘሪሁን መገርሳ ጂማን የሹመት ደብዳቤ በዱባይና በሰሜናዊ ኤምሬቶች የኢትዮጵያ ቆንስል ጄኔራል አድርጎ ተቀብሏል። መግለጫው የቆንስላ አገልግሎት ለውጥ አይጠቅስም።\n\nምንጭ፦ የኤምሬትስ የውጭ ጉዳይ ሚኒስቴር\nhttps://www.mofa.gov.ae/en/mediahub/news/2026/1/15/uae-ethiopia",
        'ti' => "ኣብ ዱባይን ሰሜናዊ ኢማራትን ሓድሽ ቆንስል ጀነራል ኢትዮጵያ\n\nሚኒስትሪ ወጻኢ ጉዳያት ኢማራት ኣብ 15 ጥሪ 2026 ከም ዝገለጾ፣ ቤት ጽሕፈቱ ዱባይ ደብዳቤ ሹመት ዘሪሁን መገርሳ ጂማ ከም ቆንስል ጀነራል ኢትዮጵያ ኣብ ዱባይን ሰሜናዊ ኢማራትን ተቐቢሉ። እቲ መግለጺ ለውጢ ኣገልግሎት ቆንስል ኣይጠቅስን።\n\nምንጪ፦ ሚኒስትሪ ወጻኢ ጉዳያት ኢማራት\nhttps://www.mofa.gov.ae/en/mediahub/news/2026/1/15/uae-ethiopia",
        'om' => "Koonsilii Jeneraalaa Itoophiyaa haaraa Dubai fi Imaaraat Kaabaatti\n\nMinisteerri Dhimma Alaa UAE 15 Amajjii 2026 akka ibsetti, waajjirri isaa Dubai xalayaa ramaddii Zerihun Megersa Jima akka Koonsilii Jeneraalaa Itoophiyaa Dubai fi Imaaraat Kaabaatti fudhateera. Ibsichi jijjiirama tajaajila koonsilaa hin eeru.\n\nMadda: Ministeera Dhimma Alaa UAE\nhttps://www.mofa.gov.ae/en/mediahub/news/2026/1/15/uae-ethiopia",
    ],
];
